1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,530
我要走了
Well, I'm off.

2
00:00:02,530 --> 00:00:03,700
我很喜欢我们周六
While I do love our tradition

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,810
依旧要聚在一起吃感恩节剩菜的传统
of still getting together on Saturday for thanksgiving leftovers,

4
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:08,310
也许下次我们可以买一只
maybe next time we can order a turkey

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,700
没有视界[黑洞边界]的火鸡
that doesn't have its own event horizon.

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,440
谁在乎
Oh, well, who cares?

7
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,520
反正要是在我的天体物理俱乐部里
I know it's totally gonna slay them

8
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,310
大家肯定都会笑死的[爱上的]
in my astrophysics club.

9
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,690
有人爱上那种俱乐部的成员才怪呢
First time anyone in that club gets slayed.

10
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:20,970
让我跟你拥抱道别吧
Let me give you a hug goodbye.

11
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:23,680
难以相信你居然已经上大学了
I cannot believe that you're already going to college.

12
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:26,000
感觉昨天你还只是个学习大学课程的
It seems like yesterday when you were a little girl

13
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,270
小姑娘而已
reading at college level.

14
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,420
瞧瞧啊
Check you out!

15
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:30,990
谢谢
Thanks.

16
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,810
我有个超性感的自习搭档要过来 所以...
I have a hot study partner coming over, so --

17
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:34,440
你在做什么呀 我的小厨子
What are you making, my little chef?

18
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:37,000
我在做利大意面
I'm making pasghetti!

19
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,480
你真可爱
You are adorable.

20
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,900
我还记得当年我用"利大意面"这种三脚猫招数
I remember when I had everyone in the palm of my hand

21
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:45,160
博取所有大人欢心的风采
with a two-foot putt like "Pasghetti."

22
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,990
咱俩都清楚你知道这个词怎么说
We both know you know how to say it.

23
00:00:47,330 --> 00:00:49,780
两位 再次感谢你们帮我收拾那栋待售房
Hey, guys, thanks again for helping me to get that listing.

24
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:50,750
西里尔的房子
Cyril's house.

25
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:52,610
-很性感吧 -必须呀
- Pretty sexy, huh? - Ridonk.

26
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:54,050
那地方让花花公子豪宅
This place makes the playboy mansion

27
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:56,140
像个老头子的家一样
look like an old folks' home.

28
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:57,880
现在好像是的
Which I guess it kind of is now.

29
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:00,390
超大泳池 超赞视野
Infinity pool, killer views,

30
00:01:00,390 --> 00:01:02,050
最高端的游戏厅 家庭影院
state-of-the-art game room, home theater...

31
00:01:02,050 --> 00:01:03,630
再加上那个四人淋浴
Plus that four-person shower.

32
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:06,010
你知道西里尔就是在那里认识他的新丈夫的吗
Did you know that's where Cyril met his new husband?

33
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,660
连安全码都很性感
Even the security code's sexy.

34
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:10,730
真的 按键上写着"性感"
Literally. It spells out "Sexy" on the keypad.

35
00:01:10,730 --> 00:01:12,680
连我都觉得那有点太拼了吧
Even I think that's trying too hard,

36
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,700
我一般最多用用香体喷雾
and at this point, I'm mostly body spray.

37
00:01:14,710 --> 00:01:17,190
单是那个超大浴缸就在四个饶舌视频中出现过
And that master bathtub alone has been in four rap videos

38
00:01:17,190 --> 00:01:19,330
还有《日界线》特别节目的一个谋杀重演出现过
plus a murder re-creation on a "Dateline" special

39
00:01:19,330 --> 00:01:21,110
剧集名叫《按摩到死》
called "Rub-a-dub Dead."

40
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:22,590
我小的时候
When I was younger,

41
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:23,750
我爸是房地产中介的事情
I was a little embarrassed

42
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:25,380
让我有点小尴尬
my dad was just a real-estate agent.

43
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:27,570
但我长大了一点之后 我意识到
But as I got older, I realized,

44
00:01:27,570 --> 00:01:30,360
他的工作可能不是世界上最酷的
Hey, he may not have the coolest job in the world,

45
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,730
但是他养活了我们
But he puts food on the table

46
00:01:31,730 --> 00:01:33,610
而且他还坐拥很多空房子
and has access to a bunch of empty houses

47
00:01:33,610 --> 00:01:34,950
让我能偷偷溜进去
I can sneak into."

48
00:01:34,950 --> 00:01:37,470
希尔格罗夫三居室带的游泳池好赞啊
Wow. Nice pool at the three-bedroom in Hillgrove.

49
00:01:37,470 --> 00:01:38,040
瞧啊
Well, looky here,

50
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:40,880
终于有个孩子对咱们的家庭产业有兴趣了
one of my kids showing interest in the family biz.

51
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,610
不知道我够不够聪明来干这活
Oh, I don't know if I'm smart enough for that.

52
00:01:42,610 --> 00:01:43,920
得背这么多东西
You have to remember so much stuff,

53
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,920
比如什么人什么时候看房
like when anyone's gonna be there.

54
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,480
日程表就是用来做这个的
That's what the datebook's for.

55
00:01:48,650 --> 00:01:49,490
而且你还得记住
Plus you have to remember

56
00:01:49,490 --> 00:01:51,730
那么些组合密码
all of those lock-box combinations.

57
00:01:51,730 --> 00:01:55,460
我用的都是一个非常特别的生日
I just use a very special birthday.

58
00:01:56,130 --> 00:01:57,440
胡迪尼的生日
Houdini's.

59
00:01:57,910 --> 00:01:59,750
我的手表落在了西里尔的浴缸边上
I left my watch by Cyril's tub.

60
00:01:59,750 --> 00:02:02,090
我一向格外谨慎 不会在老爸的这些房子
I'm usually extra careful not to leave any trace

61
00:02:02,090 --> 00:02:03,470
留下我去过的痕迹
that I was at one of my dad's houses,

62
00:02:03,470 --> 00:02:07,670
但是这个浴缸有16个脉冲射流
But this tub has 16 pulsating jets,

63
00:02:07,670 --> 00:02:09,110
整个缸底都震动着
and the whole floor vibrates

64
00:02:09,110 --> 00:02:11,440
给人进行瑞典爽身按摩
with something called "Swedish Release".

65
00:02:11,450 --> 00:02:14,840
爽得我花了20分钟才找到我的车
It took me 20 minutes to find my car in the driveway.

66
00:02:15,350 --> 00:02:16,790
我很抱歉 外公
I'm so sorry, grandpa.

67
00:02:16,790 --> 00:02:18,280
我得去工作了
I have to go do this thing for work.

68
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,550
-谢谢 -等等
- Thanks. - Hold on.

69
00:02:19,550 --> 00:02:21,830
每个人走之前都要拿一袋肉
No one leaves this house without a bag of meat.

70
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:23,880
再见 亲爱的
Bye, honey.

71
00:02:24,820 --> 00:02:26,680
你能相信我们的小姑娘现在
Can you believe how conscientious

72
00:02:26,690 --> 00:02:28,370
这么认真工作吗
our little girl has become?

73
00:02:28,370 --> 00:02:30,590
周六还赶去上班
Racing off to work on a Saturday.

74
00:02:30,590 --> 00:02:32,210
当然有30%的可能是因为她以为今天是周五
There's a 30% chance she thinks it's friday,

75
00:02:32,220 --> 00:02:33,250
但还是很认真啦
But still.

76
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:35,920
你还在生我气吗
Are you still mad at me?

77
00:02:39,150 --> 00:02:40,850
我昨天冲菲尔发脾气了
I lost my cool on Phil last night.

78
00:02:40,850 --> 00:02:43,460
但我要解释一下 我昨天奔波了一天
But in my defense, I had been traveling all day,

79
00:02:43,460 --> 00:02:46,270
结果我们对
and we had different ideas

80
00:02:46,270 --> 00:02:48,130
如何度过夜晚产生了分歧
about how we were gonna spend the evening.

81
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,790
快点进来
Get in here right now.

82
00:02:50,980 --> 00:02:53,180
快到浴缸里来 你这坏姑娘
Get in this tub, you dirty girl.

83
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,430
亲爱的 你太贴心了
Oh, honey, that is so sweet,

84
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,160
但我今早5点就起床一直忙到现在
but I've been up since 5:00 a.m.

85
00:02:56,170 --> 00:02:59,370
别想太多 宝贝 快跳进来吧
Don't overthink it, babe. Just take the plunge.

86
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:00,900
太好了 你回来了
Oh, good, you're back.

87
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:02,460
你能把水下摄像机拿过来吗
Could you grab the underwater camera?

88
00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:03,890
你在跟它们一起洗吗
You're bathing with them now?

89
00:03:03,900 --> 00:03:05,700
它们跑到了车库 浑身是油
They waddled into the garage and got oil on them.

90
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:07,040
后来它们自己过来的时候
And then when they were in here by themselves,

91
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:08,600
就是想在这里胡闹 所以...
all they wanted to do was horse around, so...

92
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:10,080
我今早跑去伯克利
I spent the morning in Berkeley

93
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:12,180
下午去波特兰
and the afternoon in Portland.

94
00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:14,270
我有权洗个澡干净清爽一下
I deserve to feel clean again.

95
00:03:14,270 --> 00:03:16,460
但现在这个舒适放松
But now the nice, soothing tub

96
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:17,940
我幻想了一整天的浴缸
that I've been dreaming about all day

97
00:03:17,940 --> 00:03:20,600
到处都是羽毛 机油还很有可能有禽流感
is filled with feathers and motor oil and probably bird flu.

98
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:22,910
所以算了 你坐好了
So, no. No. You just sit tight,

99
00:03:22,910 --> 00:03:24,860
我去用后院里的水管
and I will use the hose in the backyard.

100
00:03:26,190 --> 00:03:27,940
那你还能把摄像机拿过来吗
Could you still grab the camera?

101
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:30,570
好吧 我是凶了点
Okay. I was harsh.

102
00:03:30,570 --> 00:03:32,950
但从波特兰回来的航班真的太辛苦了
But the flight back from Portland was rough.

103
00:03:32,950 --> 00:03:35,390
我头顶的隔板上放着折叠自行车
The overheads were packed with foldable bikes,

104
00:03:35,390 --> 00:03:38,540
我还跟一个用打字机的家伙坐在一起
and I was sitting next to a guy using a typewriter.

105
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:42,220
不过 菲尔就是不肯原谅我
Still, Phil is really holding on to this one.

106
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:48,170
菲尔在生我的气
Well, Phil's mad at me.

107
00:03:48,170 --> 00:03:49,030
过来 小姑娘
Come here, little girl.

108
00:03:49,030 --> 00:03:50,310
我来抱抱你
Let me give you a hug.

109
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:51,650
你今儿个可真舍得自己的拥抱啊
You're not shy with those hugs today, are you?

110
00:03:51,650 --> 00:03:52,760
-过来吧 -还有我吗
- Oh, and come here. - Oh, me too?

111
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:53,930
我不知道怎么回事
I don't know what it is,

112
00:03:53,930 --> 00:03:57,400
不过一到节日我的情绪就容易激动
But I get so emotional around the holidays.

113
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:15,270
天哪
Oh, God.

114
00:04:15,270 --> 00:04:16,930
不 不 不 不 不
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

115
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:19,360
邓菲先生 是你吗
Mr. Dunphy? Is that you?

116
00:04:21,130 --> 00:04:21,870
海莉
Haley?

117
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:23,740
安迪 你来这里干什么
Andy, wh-- uh, what are you doing here?

118
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:24,880
布置一下明天的参观日
Setting up for an open house tomorrow.

119
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,170
你来这里干...
What are you d--

120
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,720
我滴个水神啊 谁用了浴缸
Splish, splash, who was taking a bath?!

121
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,590
我
Me.

122
00:04:29,590 --> 00:04:31,560
我昨晚偷偷溜进来 但是水龙头漏水
I snuck over last night, but the faucet leaked,

123
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,560
我猜我是太过放松了
and I guess I was so mellowed out

124
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,850
我忘了把水放干
I forgot to drain the tub.

125
00:04:33,850 --> 00:04:35,220
你这放松得真彻底啊
That's pretty darn mellowed out.

126
00:04:35,220 --> 00:04:36,580
你还熏香了吗
Were you burning incense?

127
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:38,840
是啊 当然了
Uh, yep. Sure was. Okay.

128
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:42,180
我去铺几条毛巾 你把浴缸放干
Well, I'll lay some towels down. You drain the tub.

129
00:04:45,590 --> 00:04:46,410
堵住了吗
Is it stuck?

130
00:04:46,410 --> 00:04:48,290
没有 我在倒影里看我的妆花了没
No, I'm checking my makeup in the reflection.

131
00:04:48,290 --> 00:04:49,290
当然是堵住了啊
Yes, it's stuck.

132
00:04:49,290 --> 00:04:51,220
来吧 我来帮你
Here. Let me help.

133
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,740
不用不用 我可以的
No, no. I can get it.

134
00:04:53,420 --> 00:04:54,710
来吧 好了
Here. Okay.

135
00:05:04,930 --> 00:05:05,930
天哪
Oh, my god.

136
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:07,210
放松 我没事
Relax, I'm okay.

137
00:05:07,210 --> 00:05:09,760
不 这不是李尔·韦恩视频里的浴缸吗
No. Isn't this the tub from the Lil Wayne video?

138
00:05:13,370 --> 00:05:14,720
我把我们的衣服放进烘干机了
I put our clothes in the dryer.

139
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,340
我做了个行政决策
I made an executive decision --

140
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:18,310
选了爱尔兰山干燥片
Went with the Irish mountain dryer sheets.

141
00:05:18,310 --> 00:05:20,210
爱尔兰山闻起来是什么样的
What does an Irish mountain smell like?

142
00:05:20,210 --> 00:05:23,440
30到35分钟后就知道了[模仿爱尔兰口音]
We'll find out in 30, 35 minutes.

143
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:26,090
别告诉我爸我来过好吗
Hey, uh, don't tell my dad I was here, okay?

144
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:28,560
这种小忙应该没问题[模仿爱尔兰口音]
I suppose I could do you that wee favor.

145
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,820
能再帮我一个忙吗
Do me a second favor...

146
00:05:29,820 --> 00:05:31,840
我也不喜欢这个口音
Yeah, I don't love it, either.

147
00:05:32,290 --> 00:05:34,140
你为什么要
Hey, why were you

148
00:05:34,230 --> 00:05:35,570
来这里泡澡呢
taking a bath over here, anyway?

149
00:05:35,570 --> 00:05:37,520
我只是想要一点私人时间
Oh, I just wanted a few hours to myself.

150
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:38,870
我住在父母家的地下室里
You know, I live in my parents' basement,

151
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:39,780
跟迪兰分手了
I broke up with Dylan,

152
00:05:39,780 --> 00:05:42,010
还因为感恩节吃得太多心情抑郁
I was depressed about how much I ate at Thanksgiving...

153
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:43,740
你跟迪兰分手了啊
You broke up with Dylan, huh?

154
00:05:43,740 --> 00:05:45,250
是啊 实际上就是在
Yeah. Actually, it was the day

155
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:47,030
我们在电影院看到你和贝丝那天
that we saw you and Beth at that movie.

156
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:48,300
你们在一起的感觉特别好
You guys seemed so great together

157
00:05:48,300 --> 00:05:50,240
我当时就想着 我也想要那样
I guess I just thought, "I want that."

158
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,130
我挺幸运的
I am pretty lucky.

159
00:05:51,140 --> 00:05:52,640
不过坦白讲
But for what it's worth,

160
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,320
贝丝和我并不完美
Beth and I are not perfect.

161
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,590
筹划婚礼的时候问题就暴露出来了
Things come up when you plan a wedding.

162
00:05:55,590 --> 00:05:58,270
真的有种叫"摩门教剧"的东西吗
Really? There's such a thing as Mormon drama?

163
00:05:58,270 --> 00:05:59,530
贝丝的叔叔发现我们在接待处
There was when Beth's uncle found out

164
00:05:59,530 --> 00:06:01,590
为客人供应咖啡之后就有了
we're serving coffee at the reception.

165
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,930
另外 她不想让我办单身派对
Plus, she doesn't want me to have a bachelor party.

166
00:06:03,930 --> 00:06:04,950
完全不行吗
At all?

167
00:06:04,950 --> 00:06:06,970
这是你余生之前的最后一晚
It is one night before the rest of your life.

168
00:06:06,970 --> 00:06:09,090
-你应该办的 -我也是这么说的
- You should do it up. - That's what I said.

169
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,710
对着镜子里的自己说的 不过你说得对
Well, to my mirror, but you're right.

170
00:06:11,710 --> 00:06:14,820
我应该在安稳下来之前来一场冒险
I deserve one adventure before I settle down.

171
00:06:16,190 --> 00:06:17,790
你瞧你做了什么 在这
Look what you did. Here.

172
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:20,460
你确实该做点有趣的事
Well, yeah, I mean, you got to do something fun.

173
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:25,720
要不你试试看调好它
Um... maybe you try and fix it.

174
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:28,220
好吧 应该很简单
Yeah. It should be simple enough.

175
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:30,990
好吧 我说的不是这个意思
O...kay... I did not mean to do that.

176
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:34,020
要不试一下这个
Um, maybe try this one?

177
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:40,360
我们最好别再乱按按键了
Maybe we shouldn't touch any more buttons.

178
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,540
是啊
Right.

179
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:45,530
我们刚说到什么来着
Uh... what were we talking about?

180
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:48,030
新的冒险
Having an adventure.

181
00:06:53,050 --> 00:06:54,380
天哪 是我爸吗
Oh, God, is that my dad?

182
00:06:54,610 --> 00:06:56,350
这下糟糕了
'tis a fine kettle of fish we're in!

183
00:06:56,350 --> 00:06:57,870
进洗衣间
Get in the laundry room!

184
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:00,390
动物园传来坏消息
and sad news from the zoo,

185
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:02,060
熊猫春发患上了...
Chuffa the panda has suffered a m--

186
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:03,370
不要乱碰
Stop touching stuff!

187
00:07:04,130 --> 00:07:05,600
你今儿个可真舍得自己的拥抱啊
Well, you're not shy with those hugs today, are you?

188
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,600
我不知道怎么回事
I don't know what it is,

189
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:09,820
不过一到节日我的情绪就容易激动
but I get so emotional around the holidays.

190
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:11,560
-我知道了 -我说真的
- Oh, I get it. - I really do.

191
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:14,690
-我爱你 -我也爱你
- I love you. - I love you too.

192
00:07:14,850 --> 00:07:15,890
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

193
00:07:15,900 --> 00:07:16,440
所以说今年
So, this year,

194
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:19,430
我们要用迈阿密之行给全家一个惊喜
we're surprising the family with a trip to Miami.

195
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:21,820
旅游公司需要所有人的驾照
The travel company needs everybody's driver's license

196
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:23,160
好订机票
to book the flight.

197
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:24,500
这就是为什么我们需要
That's where "sticky fingers" here

198
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:25,790
这位"妙手空空"了
comes in handy.

199
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:27,120
所有人都有一个坏表亲
Everybody has a bad cousin

200
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,870
教会你一些事
that teaches you a few things.

201
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:31,310
比如怎么抽烟 怎么偷东西
Like how to smoke, how to pick-pocket,

202
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:32,770
没有钥匙怎么启动车
how to hot-wire a car,

203
00:07:32,770 --> 00:07:34,370
怎样通过在鞋子里放大头针
how to put tacks on your shoe

204
00:07:34,370 --> 00:07:37,280
改变测谎试验的结果
when you want to throw off a-a lie-detector test.

205
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:38,720
这是哪一个表亲
Which cousin was this?

206
00:07:39,850 --> 00:07:41,490
我就是那个表亲
I am the cousin.

207
00:07:42,150 --> 00:07:43,120
再见
Bye.

208
00:07:44,710 --> 00:07:47,940
菲尔 还记得我们一年前
Phil, honey, remember those gutter covers

209
00:07:47,940 --> 00:07:49,590
订的水槽盖吗
that we ordered like a year ago?

210
00:07:49,590 --> 00:07:50,800
好消息
Good news.

211
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,940
他们终于发货了
They shipped!

212
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,910
真棒
That's exciting.

213
00:07:53,910 --> 00:07:56,310
如果我哪天为水槽盖激动你一定要杀了我
Please kill me if I ever find gutter covers exciting.

214
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:57,560
我知道 婚姻变得比名模聚会上
I know. That marriage is staler

215
00:07:57,560 --> 00:08:00,020
那一盒纸杯蛋糕还要无味
than a box of cupcakes at a supermodel retreat.

216
00:08:00,020 --> 00:08:01,580
菲尔
Oh, hay, Phil!

217
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:04,230
再次感谢你能来
Thank you again for coming!

218
00:08:04,230 --> 00:08:06,100
我们的荣幸 你一直都这么
It was our pleasure. You're always so...

219
00:08:06,100 --> 00:08:07,690
慷慨地款待我们
generous to have us!

220
00:08:07,690 --> 00:08:10,070
抱歉 我没想挠你痒
Ay, I'm sorry. I didn't wanted to tickle you.

221
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:13,390
只不过我很喜欢这种布料的感觉
It's just that I love how this fabric feel.

222
00:08:13,390 --> 00:08:15,150
这种材料叫什么名字
What is the name of this material?

223
00:08:15,150 --> 00:08:16,720
牛仔裤料
Uh...jeans.

224
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:18,590
它们摸起来还特别紧
Oh, and they feel so tight, huh?

225
00:08:18,590 --> 00:08:19,790
节日专用窍门
Oh, a little holiday trick.

226
00:08:19,790 --> 00:08:21,890
能让我少吃点
Keeps me from eating too much.

227
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:24,050
你太紧张了
I think you're too tense.

228
00:08:24,050 --> 00:08:25,090
到底发生了什么...
What the hell is going --

229
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:25,820
-亲爱的 -什么事
- Hey, hon. - Yeah?

230
00:08:25,820 --> 00:08:29,170
我们今天还没有什么机会聊天
We didn't get much of a chance to talk today.

231
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:31,950
你好吗
How are you?

232
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:32,800
不怎么好
Not great.

233
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:34,310
实话说 我不想烦你
But, honestly, I don't want to bore you.

234
00:08:34,310 --> 00:08:36,190
那你至少说给我听听
Oh, well, at least start the story.

235
00:08:36,190 --> 00:08:38,400
好吧 我从波特兰回来时
Okay. Um, well, I got back from Portland,

236
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,360
菲尔和鸭子们一同泡在浴缸里
and Phil was in the bathtub with all the ducks,

237
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,400
我完全爆发了
and I just completely lost it.

238
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,540
是的 我道过歉了
And, yes, I've apologized...

239
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:45,430
可他这次完全不肯原谅我
but he's really not letting go of it this time.

240
00:08:45,430 --> 00:08:46,970
你真有力气
I -- you're so strong!

241
00:08:47,310 --> 00:08:49,020
工作占去了你大部分时间 对吧
Work's taking up a lot of your time, isn't it?

242
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,560
你这次站在他那边吗
You're taking his side on this?

243
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:51,690
我跟你是一样的
I've been you on this.

244
00:08:51,690 --> 00:08:52,650
我在工作上遇到麻烦的时候
When I was bogged down with work,

245
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:54,120
经常跟你妈吵架
your mother and I fought all the time.

246
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:56,280
也许不是因为鸭子 我没那么奇怪
I mean, maybe not about ducks. I'm not a weirdo.

247
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:59,390
但也许他生气是因为你不在身边
But maybe he's mad at you because you're not around.

248
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,400
可我只出了两次差
But I only took like two trips.

249
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,550
也许你人在心不在
Just 'cause you're around doesn't mean you're around.

250
00:09:02,550 --> 00:09:05,060
老妈就喜欢说这种绕来绕去的话
That's one of those loopy things mom would say.

251
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:07,480
我以前也假装听不懂
I used to pretend that I didn't understand it, too,

252
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,640
但我其实懂的
but I did.

253
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,350
为什么不多花点时间陪陪彼此
Why not just make some time for each other?

254
00:09:10,350 --> 00:09:11,520
也许你说得对
Maybe you're right.

255
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:13,950
也许我应该找个周末带他到外面玩玩
Maybe I'll take him for a weekend up north, huh?

256
00:09:13,950 --> 00:09:15,320
-你怎么看 -挺好的
- What do you think? - Sure.

257
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,340
或者抛弃他
Yeah. Or leave him.

258
00:09:16,350 --> 00:09:18,300
你还是挺有魅力的 我觉得挺好
You're still attractive. Worked great for me.

259
00:09:25,110 --> 00:09:26,360
我还在感叹
I am still in shock about

260
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,610
那些冰块模子怎么能这么便宜
the deal we got on those ice-cube trays.

261
00:09:27,610 --> 00:09:30,560
对啊 感觉像是不要钱随便拿
I know. It's like we pulled off the great tray robbery.

262
00:09:31,510 --> 00:09:32,390
上面说我们可以直接
You know, it says we're supposed to

263
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,150
丢进洗碗机
throw them in the dishwasher,

264
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:34,860
但我还是打算手洗
but I'm just gonna give them a rinse.

265
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:36,830
你真是太坏了
Oh, you are so bad!

266
00:09:36,930 --> 00:09:38,920
既然我们该做的都做完了
You know, since we got all of our errands done early

267
00:09:38,930 --> 00:09:41,410
现在两个人都有时间
and we do have a little extra time on our hands...

268
00:09:41,410 --> 00:09:43,130
莉莉又去朋友家睡了
and Lily's at a sleepover.

269
00:09:45,780 --> 00:09:47,010
就是那里 往右边一点
Just -- right there. A little to the right.

270
00:09:47,010 --> 00:09:48,780
好了 非常棒 放手
Right -- yeah. Perfect. Now turn.

271
00:09:49,730 --> 00:09:51,410
我想给床垫翻个儿想好久了
I have been wanting to flip that mattress for months.

272
00:09:51,410 --> 00:09:53,590
就是啊 把事情做完的感觉真好
I know. It feels good to get stuff done.

273
00:09:53,590 --> 00:09:55,130
-是啊 -真好
- Yeah, it does! - Yes!

274
00:09:56,410 --> 00:09:56,950
除了莉莉
So, other than Lily,

275
00:09:56,950 --> 00:09:59,050
我们也没有什么活着的理由了吧
we have no real reason to be alive, right?

276
00:10:00,590 --> 00:10:01,970
天哪 是我爸吗
Oh, God, is that my dad?

277
00:10:01,990 --> 00:10:03,640
去洗衣间
Get in the laundry room!

278
00:10:04,140 --> 00:10:06,100
动物园传来坏消息
And sad news from the zoo,

279
00:10:06,140 --> 00:10:07,410
熊猫春发患上了...
Chuffa the panda has suffered a m--

280
00:10:07,410 --> 00:10:08,850
别乱碰
Stop touching stuff!

281
00:10:11,950 --> 00:10:13,120
你确定我们能这么做吗
Are you sure we should be doing this?

282
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,510
米奇尔 我们刚刚为了翻床垫而击掌庆祝
Mitchell, we just high-fived over flipping a mattress.

283
00:10:15,510 --> 00:10:18,210
那比菲尔和克莱尔为水槽盖激动可悲多了
That's way sadder than Phil and Claire's gutter covers.

284
00:10:18,210 --> 00:10:19,020
再说了 西里尔不会在意的
Plus, Cyril won't care.

285
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:21,010
他在我们家玩得不是挺开心的吗
It's not like he hasn't had his fun in our place.

286
00:10:21,010 --> 00:10:23,010
-啥 什么时候 -在你生日派对上
- What? When? - At your birthday party.

287
00:10:23,010 --> 00:10:25,240
他和格雷戈里在浴室里待了一个小时
He and Gregory were in the bathroom for like an hour.

288
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:26,090
别想歪 那是因为格雷戈里的隐形眼镜掉了
Oh, no. That's 'cause Gregory lost a contact lens.

289
00:10:26,090 --> 00:10:28,440
好吧 你呆得太可爱了
Okay, you're adorable.

290
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,270
好了 我现在要去调点鸡尾酒
All right, now, I'm gonna go make some cocktails,

291
00:10:30,270 --> 00:10:31,290
然后等到太阳下山
and then when that sun goes down...

292
00:10:31,290 --> 00:10:33,290
我们就到热水浴缸里放松放松 怎么样
you and I can get cozy in the hot tub, okay?

293
00:10:33,290 --> 00:10:34,810
好像很赞
Ohh, I like the sound of that.

294
00:10:34,930 --> 00:10:36,710
我放点有情调的音乐 好吗
I'm gonna put on some mood music, huh?

295
00:10:36,710 --> 00:10:37,800
小卡 他们这儿没有能控制整间房的
Hey, Cam, don't they have a remote

296
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,430
-遥控器吗 -有的吧
- that controls everything? - Yeah, I think so.

297
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:40,610
你知道他放在哪儿吗
You know where he keeps that?

298
00:10:40,620 --> 00:10:42,930
反正我们俩的经常陷在沙发缝里
Well, ours is always getting buried in the couch.

299
00:10:42,930 --> 00:10:44,150
找到了
Oh, here it is.

300
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,190
我爱这首歌
Ooh, I like this song.

301
00:10:48,190 --> 00:10:50,100
你想看我伴舞一曲吗
Would you like a show to go with it?

302
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:52,740
-米奇尔 -那是谁
- Mitchell! - Who's Mitchell?

303
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,460
我是魔力米奇
I'm Magic Mitch.

304
00:10:54,460 --> 00:10:55,720
白天我是焊接工人
Welder by day...

305
00:10:56,390 --> 00:10:57,940
业余时间我是脱衣舞男
stripper by choice.

306
00:10:57,940 --> 00:11:00,170
我未婚的姐姐怀着七个月的身子
My unwed sister is seven months pregnant.

307
00:11:00,170 --> 00:11:01,910
我母亲得了妇科病
My mother has some uterine issues

308
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:03,110
医保却不给报销
not covered by medicare.

309
00:11:03,110 --> 00:11:05,450
如果你愿意慷慨解囊 我会献上...
But if you want to make it rain, I will --

310
00:11:05,470 --> 00:11:07,280
米奇尔 亲爱的 你没事吧
Mitchell! Sweetie, are you okay?

311
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:07,610
我没事
Yeah, I'm fine.

312
00:11:07,620 --> 00:11:09,530
灯呢 没坏吧 还能亮吗
How's the lamp? Is it okay? Does it work?

313
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:11,190
-好着呢 你看 -那就好
- It's fine. See? - Okay.

314
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:13,180
好了 来吧 做正经事要紧
All right, now, come on. Let's get back on track.

315
00:11:13,180 --> 00:11:15,590
-是的 -我这就去调酒
- Yes. - I'll go get the cocktails.

316
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,150
你请随意
You make yourself comfortable.

317
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:18,340
必须的
I sure will.

318
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:24,410
换首欢快点的歌
Maybe something a little more lively?

319
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:26,560
这又不是《亚当和史蒂夫》 该死的
It's not "Adam and Steve", damn it.

320
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:29,060
极目所见 尸体遍野
Corpses as far as the eye can see.

321
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:30,840
你若不了解你家的冰块模子
What you don't know about your ice-cube tray

322
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:31,350
也许会害死你
could kill you.

323
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,820
也许是第一个
Maybe the first station.

324
00:11:33,310 --> 00:11:34,040
什么情况
Oh, what's happening?

325
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:34,880
我的天
Geez.

326
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:40,030
别担心克莱尔会怎么样了
Don't worry about Claire.

327
00:11:40,030 --> 00:11:42,500
我整个下午[的时间]都是你的
You've got me all afternoon.

328
00:11:47,430 --> 00:11:49,460
亲爱的 你还记得一年前
Honey, remember those gutter covers

329
00:11:49,460 --> 00:11:51,230
我们订的那批水槽盖吗
that we ordered like a year ago?

330
00:11:51,230 --> 00:11:53,470
好消息 他们终于发货了
Good news. They shipped!

331
00:11:53,910 --> 00:11:55,190
真棒
That's exciting.

332
00:11:55,190 --> 00:11:57,690
克莱尔最近工作都很忙
Claire's been working a lot lately,

333
00:11:57,690 --> 00:12:00,450
这样真是挺棒的
and it's been...great.

334
00:12:00,450 --> 00:12:02,790
这样我多出很多时间打《格尔斗兽》
It's given me a lot more time for "Battle Beasts of Gar",

335
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:05,170
一款大型的角色扮演网游
this massive online role-playing game.

336
00:12:05,170 --> 00:12:06,780
而且自从用了西里尔的顶尖游戏系统
And with Cyril's state-of-the-art gaming system,

337
00:12:06,780 --> 00:12:09,640
我就能把我那半矮人半公牛的火法师
I've been able to take my half-dwarf, half-ox fire mage --

338
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:11,010
喷火小牦牛[脑残]
PyroMiniYak --

339
00:12:11,010 --> 00:12:12,750
刷到更高的级别
to a whole new level.

340
00:12:12,750 --> 00:12:13,920
第三级
Level three!

341
00:12:14,310 --> 00:12:15,920
我们那个阵营 暴徒战队
Our guild, thugsquad,

342
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:18,910
一直在策划突袭我们的死敌阵营
has been trying to plan a raid against our arch-rival guild,

343
00:12:18,910 --> 00:12:20,800
他们的头儿是残忍的性感小兽
led by the ruthless SexyBeast,

344
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:23,130
然后我收到通知 我们终于要发动突袭
and I got a text saying it was finally happening.

345
00:12:23,150 --> 00:12:24,450
但前提是我必须得搞定克莱尔
That is, if I could get Claire

346
00:12:24,450 --> 00:12:26,760
让她容我消失几个小时
to be okay with me disappearing for a few hours.

347
00:12:26,770 --> 00:12:29,140
菲尔 亲爱的 我想跟你道个歉
Phil, honey, I want to apologize.

348
00:12:29,140 --> 00:12:30,120
为啥要道歉 你又没有
For what? You haven't -

349
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,590
露过面 没错
been around at all. I know.

350
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,310
的确如此 所以我想补偿你
I know, and I want to make it up to you.

351
00:12:33,310 --> 00:12:34,750
我挺伤心的
It was very hurtful.

352
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:37,410
肯定的 只是我有时候真的工作太忙了
Yeah. It's just sometimes I get so caught up in work

