530
00:19:11,620 --> 00:19:14,020
而我得到了
and I got one.

531
00:19:31,860 --> 00:19:34,760
那就好 的确很愉快
Good. It was fun.

532
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:37,240
回见
I'll see you later.

533
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:38,360
好的
Yep.

534
00:19:42,610 --> 00:19:44,500
乔在斯黛拉的笼子里干什么
What's Joe doing in Stella's cage?

535
00:19:44,500 --> 00:19:45,910
他清楚自己做了什么坏事
He knows what he did.

536
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:47,200
出来 孩子 出来
Go on, boy! Get!

537
00:19:51,090 --> 00:19:51,860
杰
Jay!

538
00:19:51,860 --> 00:19:53,120
我在想
So, I was thinking,

539
00:19:53,120 --> 00:19:55,940
既然迈阿密离哥伦比亚只有几小时的路程
since Miami's only a few hours away from Colombia,

540
00:19:55,940 --> 00:19:58,420
为什么不让我的亲戚飞到迈阿密去
why don't we have my relatives fly to Miami

541
00:19:58,420 --> 00:20:00,040
这样所有人就都能在一起了
so that the whole family can be together?

542
00:20:00,050 --> 00:20:01,990
歌洛莉亚 我爱你的家人 真的
Gloria, I love your family. I do.

543
00:20:01,990 --> 00:20:03,760
-可是 -你总是这样
- But -- - This is so typical.

544
00:20:03,770 --> 00:20:05,560
为你的家人我们可以做任何事
We do everything for your family,

545
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:07,770
但轮到我的家人时 你就...
but when it comes to my side of the family, then --

546
00:20:07,770 --> 00:20:10,190
-我们不去迈阿密了 -什么
- We're not going to Miami. - What?

547
00:20:10,190 --> 00:20:12,750
我为所有人买了去哥伦比亚的机票
I bought everybody plane tickets to Colombia.

548
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:14,350
杰
Ay, Jay!

549
00:20:15,540 --> 00:20:18,060
你不应该这样做的
That's not what you were supposed to do!

550
00:20:18,070 --> 00:20:19,200
我想你的意思是"你不必这样做的"
I think you mean "You shouldn't have,"

551
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,200
也许你是对的
and you're probably right.

552
00:20:20,200 --> 00:20:24,960
不 我的意思是你不该这么善解人意的
No! I mean you shouldn't have been nice about this at all!

553
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:25,530
你应该说
You were supposed to say,

554
00:20:25,540 --> 00:20:27,490
"为什么不能换个时间见你的家人呢"
"Why can't we see your family some other time?"

555
00:20:27,490 --> 00:20:28,420
而我会说 "什么时候"
and I would say, "Like when?"

556
00:20:28,430 --> 00:20:31,140
而你会说 "有什么好选的"
and then you would say, "Is never an option?"

557
00:20:31,150 --> 00:20:33,270
而我会说 "怎么能这样说话 杰·普里契特"
and I would say, "That's so mean, Jay Pritchett!"

558
00:20:33,270 --> 00:20:34,130
然后你会说
and then you would say,

559
00:20:34,130 --> 00:20:36,200
"就没什么能补偿你的方法吗 歌洛莉亚"
"Is there a way that I can make it up to you, Gloria?"

560
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:39,190
然后我会说 "不如..."
and then I would say, "How about if..."

561
00:20:39,190 --> 00:20:40,210
不如什么
If what?

562
00:20:41,610 --> 00:20:42,690
不是吧
Oh, no.

563
00:20:44,150 --> 00:20:47,080
你们好啊
Hola! Hola! Hola!

564
00:20:47,690 --> 00:20:50,180
好啊 快进来
Yeah. Come in, come in.

565
00:21:08,940 --> 00:21:12,140
你觉得会是短暂小住还是长期驻扎
Does this feel like a short visit to you or a long one?

566
00:21:12,140 --> 00:21:14,240
怀孕的那个把婴儿车都带上了 你觉得呢
The pregnant one brought a stroller.
